      "spam": false,
      "value": "This would be a nice little touch to things. It's always weird when people suddenly disappear and you don't know if they respawned, left the world, quit, or crashed. Maybe if they leave to another world the particles are the same color as portals. \n\nAlthough I imagine some might not like others knowing so for them there should be an option to turn it off but have it on by default for an improved experience for everyone.",
